"You cannot approve:\n"
" %(reasons)s"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອະນຸມັດ:\n"
" %(reasons)s"

#. module: hr_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
